\ The short code after the "KDPMember:" prefix
HOW TO RETURN shortcode id:
    IF id|10 = "KDPMember:": RETURN id@11
    RETURN id

HOW TO SHOW PROFILE:
    PUT "KDPMember:KL5UQ4f48673352" IN memberid
    PUT "Member" IN role
    PUT 1 IN points
    WRITE "=== KDP Forum Profile ===" /
    WRITE "Nickname : ", memberid /
    WRITE "Code     : ", shortcode memberid /
    WRITE "Role     : ", role /
    WRITE "Points   : ", points /
